{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-waves-opulence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"waves-opulence-sobha-hartland","about":"Waves Opulence is a premium project located in the Hartland 1 neighborhood, which is part of the larger MBR City community.The development provides residents with a host of world-class amenities, including several state-of-the-art gyms, including an outdoor gym, infinity pool, green gardens and parks with walking and jogging paths, restaurants, a children's playground, a co-working area and a yoga studio.Waves Opulence has a convenient location close to Dubai's attractions. The popular UAE Golf Club and The Track Meydan Golf Club are just a 5-minute drive away, while the Burj Khalifa, the Business Bay and Downtown Dubai business districts and the famous The Dubai Fountain show are just 15 minutes away.The complex has a unique architecture. The design of the tower is made in a modern style with the use of glass and steel, the interior design of the apartments is characterized by a dim calm design in white and beige colors. Each residence has panoramic windows and balconies offering picturesque views of the waterfront.","price":1950000,"title":"Waves Opulence","bitrix":{"id":444,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Sobha General","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sobha General","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Sobha Realty","project_location":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/126/images/2023/08/08/340x252/94Q5CS60DJd6GAv4BaQqVdJP6zEJJ11mkUpO4KR7.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/126/images/2023/08/08/464x312/94Q5CS60DJd6GAv4BaQqVdJP6zEJJ11mkUpO4KR7.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1754265,"lng":55.3076337},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/126/images/2023/08/08/340x252/OqYdkn